 const intrusion=row('采集异常状态并生成需人工评估的事件。','Collect abnormal states and generate events for assessment.','现场环境、传输、报警显示、视频评估、操作程序与维护。','Environment, transmission, alarm display, video assessment, procedures and maintenance.','验证事件报告、状态显示、记录及环境适用性，由责任人完成复核。','Verify reporting, state display, records and environmental suitability with accountable review.');
